            <li style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent);line-height:1.5;padding:14px 0 14px 20px;position:relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;top:14px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--text-dim);display:block;"></span>Too many unnecessary or confusing features</li>
            <li style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent);line-height:1.5;padding:14px 0 14px 20px;position:relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;top:14px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--text-dim);display:block;"></span>Grok/AI everywhere</li>
            <li style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent);line-height:1.5;padding:14px 0 14px 20px;position:relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;top:14px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--text-dim);display:block;"></span>Doesn't understand difference between lists and communities</li>
