        <p style="display:inline-block;background:#f5c518;color:#000;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:10px;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">Social User</p>
        <p>30 · Market Analyst · Stockholm</p>
        <p style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:4px;">Most Used Apps: X, Instagram, Reddit &amp; WhatsApp</p>
